{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/454580-some-new-invictus-oaths-thoughts","id":454580,"title":"Some New Invictus Oaths [Thoughts?]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-23T10:48:57-07:00","id":454580,"title":"Some New Invictus Oaths [Thoughts?]","content":"So, I was just thinking (a dangerous thing), and I came up with the following:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\">Celestial Bureaucrat (\u2022\u2022\u2022)</span><br /> Developed by the Chinese equivalent of the Invictus, this &quot;oath&quot; reflects a very different viewpoint on the <i>Noblesse Oblige</i> of the Invictus.<br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Invictus Status \u2022\u2022\u2022, Notary<br /> <b>Effects:</b> The Invictus gains an honorary Rank of [Invictus Status / 2], rounded up. More importantly (and worryingly), they may act as a Notary for Oaths between members of the Invictus and Ephemeral beings - unfortunately, the Kindred are <i>always</i> the vassals in such situations.<br /> Oaths sealed through this channel allow the liege to convert Vitae gained from the Oath into Essence on a one-for-one basis, and Oaths that reference Disciplines consider the liege's Influences to be Disciplines (if an Oath would transfer a &quot;Discipline&quot; to the vassal, the vassal may spend Vitae instead of Essence to power it, and rolls Presence + Politics + Invictus Status as the activation pool.)<br /> Similarly, the liege is considered to have whatever Social merits that make sense for the purposes of any Oaths they swear; while a Spirit might not have <i>actually</i> have Staff (Occult) \u2022 to reflect their cult, they do for the purposes of Oaths such as the Oath of the Handshake Deal.<br /> The good news for the vassals, however, is that the Ephemeral Being gains a second Ban that prohibits them from breaking the letter of the Oath. This Ban lasts as long as the Oath itself; any conflicts between their original Ban and this Ban are resolved in favour of their original Ban.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\">Oath of the Official Proxy (\u2022\u2022\u2022)</span><br /> In a society where those in power often end up sleeping for years at a time, it's useful to have a vassal who can act in your stead. Hence the invention of this Oath.<br /> <b>Effects:</b> The vassal immediately gains a second-stage blood bond with regards to their liege; however, as long as they have this blood bond, they may act as a proxy for their liege for the purposes of swearing oaths. Whenever they swear an Oath as the liege, they may pass the benefits (and drawbacks) of that Oath to their liege.<br /> <b>Special:</b> A given character may only act as the liege for one instance of the Oath of the Official Proxy at a time; similarly, you may only act as the vassal for a single instance of the Oath at any given time. It isn't too uncommon for a pair of allies to declare mutual Oaths of the Official Proxy.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T15:52:23-07:00","id":906021,"title":"","content":"Just wanted to let you know that I finally got around to adapting this for my Age of Azar project. Just see <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1wOZ67XDyNp1wPxrDUuaraCBdNLjqyFXTV5V5I3FhTOk/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">in here</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}